// The Windows functions the host implements, as
//   EXPORT(dll, name, return type, (parameters), (arguments))
// guest_abi.c turns each line into a Windows x64 entry point that forwards to
// win_<name> (System V, in the win32/*.cpp files), and into the table the
// import resolver and GetProcAddress use. The C++ side declares win_<name>
// from the same line, so a signature that differs does not compile.
// Types are fixed-width: WCHAR is uint16_t (wchar_t is 32-bit here), BOOL is
// int32_t, DWORD uint32_t, SIZE_T uint64_t, HANDLE/HMODULE void*.

